In `C:\Users\vamsh\.config\opencode\opencode.jsonc`, change:

```jsonc
"reasoningEffort": "max"
```

to either:

```jsonc
"reasoningEffort": "medium" // recommended
```

or:

```jsonc
"reasoningEffort": "low"
```

If that setting is not already in the file, add this model configuration:

```jsonc
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "model": "openrouter/meta/muse-spark-1.3-contributor",
  "provider": {
    "openrouter": {
      "models": {
        "meta/muse-spark-1.3-contributor": {
          "options": {
            "reasoningEffort": "medium"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Save the file, exit OpenCode fully, then start `opencode` again and reselect the model with `/models`. Use **medium** for normal implementation; use **low** for exploration and simple tasks. OpenCode supports `reasoningEffort` as a per-model option and supports switching model variants. [OpenCode model configuration](https://opencode.ai/docs/models/)
